/**
 * Hierarchical tree view component with optional file tree rendering.
 * [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻elements🔖tree🪨tree](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/elements.tsx/s/Tree/d/i/Tree)
